{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act36side_level_act36side_01_beg",
  "groupId": "act36side",
  "stageId": "act36side_01",
  "title": "源石虫农家乐",
  "storyCode": "DT-1",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act36side/level_act36side_01_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "61f187b7f9891479e3d1ce4d01b3807cbb7469fb635f29e01f8525f8b8c6790f",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "法琳",
      "text": "哥......快逃！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "法琳！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "啊，是梦......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "你总算醒了，莱欧斯！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "你精神怎么样，有觉得头晕吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "头倒是不怎么晕......但突然感觉有点饿了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "这里是......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "天空，太阳，树林......还有......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "这里看起来很像是迷宫的外面，但不论是我、森西还是齐尔查克，都觉得这里不是任何我们见过的地方。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "而且你看，还是没有反应......我都试了好几次了，微小精灵一点都不回应我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "真是少见......\n森西？你在干什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "text": "老夫在调查这里的土质。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "text": "你们看，这里的土壤湿润、色深，在掌心揉搓变热之后有臭味，说明里面含有大量腐殖质......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "也就是说？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "text": "也就是说，非常适合种植！和魔像背上的土质非常相像！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "没问你这个！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "text": "玛露西尔！你把鸟都吓到了，我差点被它撞下来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "text": "我这有一个好消息和一个坏消息。首先，我们在周围查看了一圈，都没有见到什么魔物，这附近应该相当安全。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "好消息是什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "没有魔物不就是好消息吗！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "坏消息呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "text": "坏消息是，这个空间非常宽广，而且周围的环境和我知道的完全不一样。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "text": "我从上面看到，这里甚至只是森林的边缘。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "text": "从一层到五层，老夫从来没见过，也从来没听说过有人发现过这样的地方。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "......也就是说......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "也就是说......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯小队",
      "text": "我们可能是误打误撞来到了迷宫不为人知的新区域？！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "text": "天上飞过去的鸟都是从来没见过的品种，很奇怪，与其说是另一个区域，这里甚至更像是另一个空间。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "这里有没有可能就像是......活画里那样？我们被带到了一个像画中世界一样的新地方？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "也就是说，我们会遇到未知的魔物？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "说不定还能试试它们的味道？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "你在说什么胡话！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "我们的目的是赶紧去救法琳，现在可不是能在未知区域浪费时间的时候！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "而且有一件事很重要，我刚刚尝试了很多次，但在这里我只能使用一些简单的魔法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "......这确实是一个很严肃的问题......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "text": "而且......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "而且？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "text": "而且这片森林和土地很奇怪，很像是为了让植被在这里生长，专门有人开垦出来的一片区域，老夫很清楚这样的手段。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "你根本没有在意我的魔法变弱了这件事吧！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "text": "这样说的话，我刚才其实还发现森林外面有座有点奇怪的木屋，里面可能会有人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "text": "我们先去那边问问看吧，说不定能问到些什么呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "你也把话题扯开了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "有点奇怪的木屋？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "那就先去看看好了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "喂！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "到了这么陌生的环境，我们得多加小心啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "没人知道这个木屋里是什么，万一是某种新的有敌意的亚人......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "我建议让我先......\n喂！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "text": "木屋不大，但是被人围上了不少栅栏。栅栏的每根木桩都很牢固，深深地插在地里。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "text": "栅栏的高度不高，一般人能轻松翻越，明显不是为了防止人进入，更像是为了阻止生物从地下挖洞逃走而设置的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "text": "地上到处都是黑色的石头，这些是用来做标记的吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "text": "喂！你们不要到处乱跑啊！要是遇到了危险怎么办？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "（低声）剑助？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "（剑助会对附近的魔物有反应，难道说......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "text": "就说不要到处乱跑了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "——哇啊啊啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "它、它会动！石头下面，有、有软软的东西！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "呀！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "这、这是把石头当成自己甲壳的虫类魔物吗？这层硬壳既是保护手段，也是攻击手段？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "喂，你这家伙就在一边看着吗！能不能快点搞定它！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "这种坚硬的外壳已经保护到了它最柔弱的腹部，通常会有大量神经的脖颈也覆盖了毫无缝隙的外壳。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "单凭我们的武器可能很难一下子把它杀死。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "玛露西尔，用你的魔法！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "text": "用小一点的魔法，不要破坏这里的生态环境！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "我现在也放不出更大的魔法了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "哼，也就是走路菇的水准。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "果然是新型的魔物！玛露西尔你没事吧？被它攻击的感觉如何？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "我没事，感谢你的关心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "text": "嗯......壳很硬，没想到这种生物竟然覆盖着这样的矿质外壳，真少见。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "那、那别的部分呢！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "text": "（用斧子把源石虫翻过来）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克&玛露西尔",
      "text": "欸！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "是什么样的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "text": "别靠这么近！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "text": "这种未知的生物，千万不要直接碰触。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "text": "这种伏地生活的动物，多半靠食用腐殖质维生，一般都会携带很多病菌和寄生虫，直接上手触摸的话说不定会被感染。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "确实......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "（嗯？......剑助？我们不都已经发现这些虫子了吗？难道还有什么危险......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "......等等！这附近的石头全都“活”过来了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "既然如此，只能试着一起解决掉！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "哈，哈......这招怎么样？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "text": "小心！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "text": "有各种各样的品种！有的还会吐出液体！小心......液体似乎有腐蚀性！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "居然、居然还会喷出腐蚀性液体！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "为什么这时候还能在意这种事情啊！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "text": "我好像对它们造成不了什么伤害，交给你们了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "快过来！我们先进这个小木屋躲一躲！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "......呃......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊这是什么啊啊啊！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "text": "森西，你认识这个穿着全身铠甲的兽人吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "text": "唔，老夫认识的兽人穿着都比较单薄，没见过这样的。他应该是木屋的主人，不然老夫问一问？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "还问什么？快、快跑啊！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "text": "森西，快把我放下来啦！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "他、他还在追我们吗？！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "那是什么生物啊，是某种兽人吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "text": "真的不用老夫去问问吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "你们还在好奇什么啊！他明显是要拿着那把奇怪的大刀杀我们！肯定是我们惹怒了他！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "text": "我猜，惹怒他的是你的爆炸魔法吧！要不然你去向他道个歉试试看？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "我才不会向兽人道歉！而且不用魔法，怎么赶走石头虫啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "这里果然是没来过的区域！好多新奇的东西！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "text": "还有森西，我自己会跑，你放我下来！欸欸欸——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "我没在任何书上见过，看起来挺酷的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "text": "莱欧斯！！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
